# Prunes this subtree from reventless-gwt discovery (test tree + component tree).
#
# These are the GWT DSL framework modules — `Automation_GWT`, `Behavior_GWT`,
# `Mapping_GWT`, etc. — i.e. the `*_GWT.Make` functors the test runner is built
# from. They are named with the same `_GWT` suffix that marks user test files, so
# discovery would otherwise list each one as a test, even though loading the
# compiled `*_GWT.res.mjs` registers no cases (the `describe`/`test` calls live
# inside the functors, not at module top level).
#
# The package's real tests live in `tests/`, which this prune does not touch.
